{"title": "Sentinel: Vengeance", "pageid": 21521, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sentinel:_Vengeance", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Sentinel_Vengeance.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Sentinel_Vengeance.webp/300px-Sentinel_Vengeance.webp, /w/images/1/1d/Sentinel_Vengeance.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Sentinel_Vengeance.webp/300px-Sentinel_Vengeance.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1d/Sentinel_Vengeance.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Sentintel: Vengeance</b> is a passive feature obtainable by the <a href=\"/wiki/Sentinel\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sentinel\">Sentinel</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a>. Users of this feature can attack enemies who attack an ally within your melee range.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When an enemy in melee range attacks an ally, you can use a <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a> to make a weapon attack against that enemy. Target ally must not have the Sentinel feat. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Sentinel\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sentinel\">Sentinel</a>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Blythe\" title=\"Blythe\">Blythe</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cirian\" title=\"Cirian\">Cirian</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Derysia\" title=\"Derysia\">Derysia</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Eni\" title=\"Eni\">Eni</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Feona\" title=\"Feona\">Feona</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fustian\" title=\"Fustian\">Fustian</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Glyria\" title=\"Glyria\">Glyria</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hoarding_Merregon\" title=\"Hoarding Merregon\">Hoarding Merregon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kevo_Phogge\" title=\"Kevo Phogge\">Kevo Phogge</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/M%27alice\" title=\"M'alice\">M'alice</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Merregon_Legionnaire\" title=\"Merregon Legionnaire\">Merregon Legionnaire</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mitchia\" title=\"Mitchia\">Mitchia</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nov_Shmoz\" title=\"Nov Shmoz\">Nov Shmoz</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rycke\" title=\"Rycke\">Rycke</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Spaulder\" title=\"Spaulder\">Spaulder</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Vengeful_Merregon\" title=\"Vengeful Merregon\">Vengeful Merregon</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>If two player characters, A and B, are simultaneously active in combat (due to initiative order) and character A has the Sentinel feat, then character B can trigger a Sentinel: Vengeance attack by forcing an enemy (close to character A) to make an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/30px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Opportunity Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\">Opportunity Attack</a>. Character A may also receive <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/30px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Extra Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\">Extra Attack</a> for this attack.</li>\n<li>Sentinel: Vengeance will attack with both weapons if dual wield attacks is toggled on.\n<ul><li>If using the reaction attack outside of the character's turn, it will attack with both weapons.</li>\n<li>If using the reaction on the character's turn (character A as detailed in the example above), the character must still have a bonus action available to get the two attacks. So, just use this reaction attack before using the bonus action.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Unlike Opportunity Attack, Sentinel: Vengeance attack is triggered even while wielding a ranged weapon.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sentinel:_Snare\" title=\"Sentinel: Snare\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Sentinel_Snare_Icon.webp/20px-Sentinel_Snare_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Sentinel_Snare_Icon.webp/30px-Sentinel_Snare_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Sentinel_Snare_Icon.webp/40px-Sentinel_Snare_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sentinel: Snare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Sentinel_Snare_Icon.webp/20px-Sentinel_Snare_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bc/Sentinel_Snare_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sentinel:_Snare\" title=\"Sentinel: Snare\">Sentinel: Snare</a> does not apply to this attack, and an enemy hit with this attack can still move. This can be used to avoid getting stuck against enemies with Sentinel feat.</li>\n<li>While the other Sentinel feats apply to druids in Wild Shape, this only applies to the Wild Shape forms that wield weapons, that is, Air, Fire, and Water Myrmidons.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202305\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1168/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9970/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7264/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1033/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1000042/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   34.827      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   34.827      1 -total\n 26.88%    9.362      3 Template:SmSAI\n 19.59%    6.821      3 Template:Icon_link\n 18.28%    6.367      3 Template:Icon_text\n 13.52%    4.709      6 Template:Trim\n 12.11%    4.216      1 Template:PageSeo\n 11.28%    3.927      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 11.07%    3.857      1 Template:Passive_creatures_list\n 10.26%    3.574      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n-->\n